// Committed signing defaults. Personal settings (DEVELOPMENT_TEAM) live in the
// gitignored Signing.local.xcconfig, written by `yarn ios:deploy` — the #include?
// is optional on purpose: simulator builds need no signing, and xcodebuild
// (unlike the Xcode GUI) errors out on a missing baseConfiguration file, so the
// committed file must always exist.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
